<title>USA: Stewart &amp; Stevenson gets $21 mln in orders.</title>
<headline>Stewart &amp; Stevenson gets $21 mln in orders.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewart &amp; Stevenson Services Inc said Tuesday it received two orders for gas turbine equipment, valued at $21 million, in June.</p>
<p>The company said the orders include six EGT turbines for overseas compression applications.</p>
<p>Stewart &amp; Stevenson makes gas turbine powered equipment.</p>
